  {
    "id": 8782044070100,
    "title": "Brainstorm",
    "body_html": "<p>Sativa</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\">This Haze strain, which is predominantly sativa, comes from the Netherlands and has a sativa/indica ratio of about 90:10, offering a highly cerebral experience. Created in Amsterdam by Delta 9 Labs, Brainstorm Haze is a cross between Stargazer and a traditional landrace strain from Thailand</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Product Review:</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>Reviewer (Mars): </strong>So far my favourite new sativa stain as an indica smoker. Its sweet, citrusy aroma and deep purple, sticky buds!<br>Despite a slight cough upon smoking, the effects are decidedly positive. I felt clear-headed, focused, and energize and could study after. I had no anxiety. A single bong hit provides a great, clear high, suggesting a potent and enjoyable sativa experience. 10/10</p>\n<p><strong>Reviewer (Abu): </strong>Spicy and Pineapple Aroma<br>Smooth smoke minimum cough, heavy scratch on the throat.<br>Mellow head high in a about 20 minutes after the first puff. Gave me a talkative effect Overall potency 7/10.</p>\n<p><strong>Reviewer (Kim): </strong>The feeling really goes with the name because of the uplifting, focused feel the strain gives. It's definitely a sativa because the first pull made my whole body sweat. It's an interesting sativa because it didn't give me any paranoia or anxiety.\u00a0It's a very strong smoke so it's not recommended for first time smokers, the reason for saying that is because it's an almost instant head high. It taste very spicy with a gas and citrus after taste.\u00a0The bud itself looks and smells amazing with a very pungent terp smell. it's frosted but is sexy to a real stoner. It's sugar, frosted look and it's moist feel is just unbelievable.</p>",
    "vendor": "Cannibisters - The Herbal Apothecary",
    "product_type": "Flower",
    "created_at": "2025-03-03T12:16:00+02:00",
    "handle": "brain-storm",
