    "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><strong data-end=\"39\" data-start=\"0\">70/30 Sativa\u00a0<br></strong><br data-end=\"42\" data-start=\"39\"><span>Spark creativity with Brainstorm \u2014 a sativa-dominant hybrid known for its clear-headed high and uplifting effects. Ideal for daytime use, this smooth joint enhances focus and mental clarity, making it perfect for brainstorming sessions, creative projects, or social vibes.</span></p>",
