    "body_html": "<p>Assorted Colours:\u00a0</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">- Black\u00a0</span><br></p>\n<div>\n<span data-canva-clipboard=\"\"></span>\n<div>\n<p><span>The Cannibisters Hoodie combines comfort and style with a sleek design featuring </span><span>a new and exclusive \u2018I Love Cannibisters\u2019</span><span> logo</span><span> on the front, </span><span> </span><span>and \u2018Nip It In The Bud!\u2019 logo on the back. </span><span>Made from soft, high-quality fabric, </span><span>w</span><span>ith a relaxed fit and adjustable drawstrings</span><span>. </span><span>Available in a range of sizes</span><span>.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>",
