    "body_html": "<div>\n<span data-canva-clipboard=\"\"></span>\n<div>\n<p><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><span>Indulge in the rich, earthy flavours of </span><strong data-end=\"94\" data-start=\"71\">Pure Michigan Rosin</strong><span>, an </span><strong data-end=\"125\" data-start=\"99\">indica-dominant hybrid</strong><span> created by crossing </span><strong data-end=\"155\" data-start=\"146\">Oreoz</strong><span> with </span><strong data-end=\"177\" data-start=\"161\">Mendo Breath</strong><span>. This </span><strong data-end=\"202\" data-start=\"184\">1-gram extract</strong><span> offers a smooth, potent experience, delivering calming effects with sweet, doughy undertones. Developed through a collaboration between </span><strong data-end=\"359\" data-start=\"339\">ThugPug Genetics</strong><span> and </span><strong data-end=\"386\" data-start=\"364\">3rd Coast Genetics</strong><span>, this rosin is perfect for unwinding and enjoying a relaxing high.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->",
