  {
    "id": 7981711261908,
    "title": "Chinese Medicine Consultation",
    "body_html": "<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<blockquote type=\"cite\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div class=\"yahoo-style-wrap\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" data-setdir=\"false\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" data-setdir=\"false\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Chinese medicine diagnosis is a holistic approach to understanding and treating illness. It is based on the belief that the body is a complex system of interconnected parts, and that disease is caused by imbalances in this system.</div>\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Dr Sorger uses a variety of methods to diagnose disease, including:</div>\n<ul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-9:0\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:133\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Inspection:\u00a0This involves looking at the patient's overall appearance, including their complexion, skin condition, and posture.</li>\n<li data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:114\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Auscultation and olfaction:\u00a0This involves listening to the patient's breathing and smelling their body odor.</li>\n<li data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:101\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Inquiry:\u00a0This involves asking the patient about their symptoms, medical history, and lifestyle.</li>\n<li data-sourcepos=\"8:1-9:0\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Palpation:\u00a0This involves feeling the patient's pulse and tongue.</li>\n</ul>\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\">The information gathered from these methods is used to develop a diagnosis of the patient's condition. This diagnosis is based on the patient's unique set of symptoms and signs, and will take into account their overall health and well-being.</div>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" data-setdir=\"false\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Many people find that Chinese medicine can be an effective way to treat a wide range of conditions, both acute and chronic.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</blockquote>",
    "vendor": "Cannibisters - The Herbal Apothecary",
    "product_type": "",
    "created_at": "2023-10-02T13:00:23+02:00",
    "handle": "chinese-medicine-consultation",
