    "id": 8607611486420,
    "title": "Cocktail Joint",
    "body_html": "<div>\n<span data-canva-clipboard=\"\"></span>\n<div>\n<p><span>Experience variety with the Cannibisters Cocktail Joint\u2014a premium pre-roll blending multiple indoor-grown strains. This unique mix delivers rich flavors and balanced effects, perfect for any occasion.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<span><strong>Premium Indoor Blend</strong>:</span><span> A mix of high-quality indoor strains for diverse flavors and effects.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<span><strong>Dynamic Effects</strong>:</span><span> Enjoy a balanced combination of uplifting and relaxing sensations.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<span><strong>Ready-to-Enjoy</strong>:</span><span> Expertly rolled and conveniently packaged for on-the-go use.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<span><strong>Smooth Burn</strong>:</span><span> Crafted for a consistent, even burn every time.</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><strong>1 Gram, No Tobacco.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
