    "body_html": "<p>75/25 Sativa</p>\n<p>Elvis is a sativa hybrid strain produced by crossing a male AK-47 with The Pure.</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\" data-mce-style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Product Review</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>User 1:\u00a0</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Elvis was fun strain to smoke because it was uplifting</li>\n<li>The bud itself looked exceptionally beautiful and smelled genuinely nice</li>\n<li>It made me energetic, happy, giggly and talkative</li>\n<li>It tasted sweet, earthy, flowery</li>\n</ul>",
    "vendor": "Cannibisters - The Herbal Apothecary",
