    "body_html": "<p>Grinder</p>\n<p>Joint Maker - <meta charset=\"utf-8\">6 Joints\u00a0</p>\n<div>\n<span data-canva-clipboard=\"\"></span>\n<div>\n<p><span>The </span><span>All-Purpose Herb Grinder</span><span> is a versatile and convenient tool for grinding and packing herbs quickly and mess-free. Featuring a heavy-duty polycarbonate body, this grinder is compact, lightweight, and built for durability, making it perfect for use at home or on the go. Its innovative design includes a built-in funnel and storage chamber that holds up to 7 empty cones. In just 30 seconds, you can grind your herbs and pack your cones effortlessly with a simple twist. Portable and easy to carry, it\u2019s the perfect herb accessory for parties, picnics, or trips.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><br></p>\n<!---->",
