  {
    "id": 8782047051988,
    "title": "Grapefruit",
    "body_html": "<p>90/10 Sativa</p>\n<div>\n<span data-canva-clipboard=\"\"></span>\n<div>\n<p><span>Grapefruit</span><span> is a sativa-dominant cannabis strain renowned for its uplifting effects and distinctive citrus aroma. Thought to be a cross between Cinderella 99 and a landrace sativa, this strain offers a unique blend of flavours and therapeutic benefits.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Product Review</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Reviewer (Kim): </strong>This is the perfect strain to start your day with because of its uplifting feel. It's a smooth and tasty smoke. It taste of citrus, pine and some sweet taste left in your mouth after smoking. It gives a kick start to your day. It's a mild smoke recommended for stoners that would like to have a uplifting morning feel and get some work done .</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Reviewer (Mars): </strong><span>Orange citrus smell! Very potent</span><br><span>Tastes like grapefruit too! </span><span>Love the little orange hairs. The bud is pretty! </span><span>Coughed very little with this strain. </span><span>Got a bit hot from the bong pull and high went straight to my head.</span><br><span>Went to work out and it definitely kept me going, also great for listening to music.</span><br><span>I just wanted to go dancing! </span><span>8/10</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Reviewer (Kyle): </strong>Very orangey creamey Terps. Reminds me of Mimosa, has a similar terp and after taste of orange peel and gas. Slight cough, but it was very tasty. Straight to the head and behind the eyes high.\u00a0 Super active high. I\u2019m usually tired after work but I can properly function with this high. I also feel more alert, but a little bit less agile and sharp. It\u2019s a similar high to the pussy wagon to be honest. Strong head high and active.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p>\n</div>\n</div>",
    "vendor": "Cannibisters - The Herbal Apothecary",
    "product_type": "Flower",
    "created_at": "2025-03-03T12:22:06+02:00",
    "handle": "grape-f",
