    "id": 8625795760340,
    "title": "Grease Monkey - Rosin Moonstick",
    "body_html": "<div>\n<span data-canva-clipboard=\"\"></span>\n<div>\n<p><span>Unwind with the Greased Monkey Moonstick\u2014a potent joint packed with hash, painted in rosin, and rolled in kief for an ultra-smooth, powerful hit. This indica-leaning hybrid, a cross of Gorilla Glue #4 and Cookies &amp; Cream, delivers rich diesel and sweet vanilla flavors with a deeply relaxing high that melts away stress and tension.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><span><strong>Indica Dominent</strong> Hybrid</span></li>\n<li>\n<span><strong>1 Gram</strong> of </span><span>Flower</span><span></span>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Hash </strong></li>\n<li><strong>Kief </strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
