  {
    "id": 8139499307220,
    "title": "Jack Harer",
    "body_html": "<p>80/20 Sativa</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Jack Herer is a legendary sativa hybrid with spicy citrus-pine flavours and a clear, creative high. Perfect for daytime energy, socialising, and sparking inspiration.</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Product Review</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong><span>User 1:</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">I had it as a wake and bake and started cleaning, did my washing and packed my cupboard. Overall, it gave me energy to do a lot of things at the same time.</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">I could feel the indica as well, that made me calm and relaxed as I had energy.</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Recommended for people that need energy and would like to focus the entire day.</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It was sweet, fruity and spicy</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>User 2:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Smooth smoke</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Smells like berries, citrus and sweets</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It made me feel euphoric and happy\u00a0</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Not so intense and a great sativa for chilling</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">I am an indica person and this is a great sativa for those those who usually get anxiety</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>User 3:\u00a0</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It was a great smoke and had no coughing</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">I felt focused and could read a nice book</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Great for a day time smoke<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0</p>",
    "vendor": "Cannibisters - The Herbal Apothecary",
    "product_type": "Flower",
    "created_at": "2024-02-29T13:04:08+02:00",
    "handle": "jack-herer-1",
