  {
    "id": 8403114131668,
    "title": "Permanent Marker",
    "body_html": "<p>Sativa Dom</p>\n<p>In 2022, the independent brand Doja Exclusive from Los Angeles launched the Permanent Marker cannabis strain, making it available on both the East and West coasts. This unique strain was developed and cultivated by JBeezy from Seed Junky Genetics and was carefully chosen by Doja Pak. Permanent Marker is a blend of various popular cultivars, including Biscotti, Sherb Bx, and Jealousy.</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Product Review</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>User 1:\u00a0</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>A great smoke and didn't cough once</li>\n<li>Made me smile the whole time</li>\n<li>Gave me giggles and made everything 10x funnier</li>\n<li>Made me loose my train of thought, so it's best to smoke for chilling with friends</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>User 2:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Funny thing about this strain is, after crushing it, it smells like a permanent marker.</li>\n<li>LOL it tastes of permanent marker as well, vanilla and sweet taste too. It was great.</li>\n<li>Instant high but a full boost of energy and focus.\u00a0</li>\n</ul>\n<!---->",
    "vendor": "Cannibisters - The Herbal Apothecary",
    "product_type": "Flower",
    "created_at": "2024-05-20T11:42:59+02:00",
    "handle": "permeant-marker",
